'''Lunala ex''' (Japanese: '''ルナアーラex''' ''Lunala ex'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

