==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Lunala}}.
*'''Psychic Connect''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-Power}} on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Gardevoir|8}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
*'''Lunar Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Lunatone|8}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.

